# nervepack lifecycle-hook registration manifest -- read by np_hook.install_hooks()
# (dispatched as `cli.py setup install-hooks`). One pipe-delimited row per hook:
#   event|matcher|command
# Rows are registered in FILE ORDER; order matters within an event -- in
# particular session-flush MUST be the LAST SessionEnd row so it runs after
# episodic-capture + evaluator have written this session to the inboxes.
# matcher is empty for all but the tool-scoped PreToolUse/PostToolUse hooks.
# Backgrounded commands keep their `>/dev/null 2>&1 &` (or bare ` &`): the `&`
# alone does NOT detach -- the child inherits the hook's stdout pipe and Claude
# Code reads it to EOF, so an un-redirected backgrounded hook blocks session
# start until the child exits. See np-kb-claude-headless-scripting.
# Retired the 11 NN-install-*.sh installers + np-hook-lib.sh (phase 13).
#
# {NP_DIR} is substituted at install time with the engine repo root, resolved by
# np_paths from its OWN file location -- never guessed, and never assumed to be
# ~/Code/nervepack. Before #257 these rows carried that path literally, so a
# clone anywhere else registered 26 hooks pointing at a directory that does not
# exist. Hooks fail open (ARCHITECTURE invariant 1), so nothing would have
# errored: the whole system would have quietly done nothing.
#
# On a Git-bash host the substituted path is normalised to forward slashes, since
# these commands are routed through bash and a backslash there is an escape.
#
# --- 50: sync + dashboard (sync is cli.py-dispatched; 40-sync-nervepack.sh retired, phase 17) ---
SessionStart||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py sync >/dev/null 2>&1 &
SessionEnd||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py sync exit >/dev/null 2>&1 &
SessionStart||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook open-dashboard >/dev/null 2>&1 &
# --- 51: consult-nervepack directive (synchronous) ---
SessionStart||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook session-directive
# --- 52: episodic capture + recall ---
SessionEnd||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook episodic-capture session-end &
PreCompact||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook episodic-capture checkpoint
UserPromptSubmit||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook episodic-recall
# --- 53: lessons layer (six lesson-guard matchers coexist via (matcher, base) dedup) ---
# Edit/Write/Skill + a broad mcp__.* catch-all extend Phase 2 coverage beyond
# Bash/Read (issue #152) -- Claude Code only invokes a PreToolUse hook for a
# tool name matching a REGISTERED matcher here; which lesson (if any) actually
# fires is then decided by lesson_guard.py's own tool_name_match regex.
PreToolUse|Bash|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook lesson-guard
PreToolUse|Read|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook lesson-guard
PreToolUse|Edit|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook lesson-guard
PreToolUse|Write|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook lesson-guard
PreToolUse|Skill|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook lesson-guard
PreToolUse|mcp__.*|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook lesson-guard
UserPromptSubmit||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook lesson-recall
# --- 53b: spec-drift guard (Write/Edit-scoped; the SECOND hook permitted to
# block -- see ARCHITECTURE invariant 1). Denies an edit outside the
# blast_radius of change-specs/<branch-slug>.md. Silent in any repo with no
# such spec, which is every repo but this one today.
PreToolUse|Write|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook drift-guard
PreToolUse|Edit|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook drift-guard
# --- 54: performance evaluator ---
SessionEnd||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook evaluator &
# --- 55: promotion flush (LAST SessionEnd row -- see header) ---
SessionEnd||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook session-flush
# --- 56: back-capture sweep (reliable capture path) ---
SessionStart||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook backcapture-sweep >/dev/null 2>&1 &
# --- 57: struggle escalation ---
UserPromptSubmit||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook struggle-escalation
# --- 59: skill-trigger recall ---
UserPromptSubmit||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook skill-trigger-recall
# --- 59b: security-review recall ---
UserPromptSubmit||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook security-recall
# --- 61: resume pointer ---
SessionStart||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook resume-sessionstart &
UserPromptSubmit||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook resume-recall
# --- 63: open artifact on write (Write-scoped) ---
PostToolUse|Write|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook open-artifact
# --- 64: turn-completion gate (Stop + SubagentStop; the one hook permitted to
# block). The SubagentStop row exists because a fan-out's agents write and report
# with no other form check; turn_gate skips the delivery checks on that event
# (turn_gate.subagent controls the lane).
Stop||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook turn-gate
SubagentStop||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook turn-gate
# --- 65: durable-text form gate (PreToolUse). One row per matcher: Claude Code
# only invokes a PreToolUse hook for a REGISTERED matcher, same constraint the
# six lesson-guard rows above exist for.
PreToolUse|Write|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook form-gate
PreToolUse|Edit|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook form-gate
PreToolUse|Artifact|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook form-gate
PreToolUse|Bash|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook form-gate
PreToolUse|SendUserFile|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook form-gate
PreToolUse|mcp__.*|python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook form-gate
# --- 66: form directive (UserPromptSubmit). The PREVENTIVE half of the form
# pair. turn-gate above is corrective, and correction on a Stop event always
# arrives after the reader saw the text -- this puts the contract in front of
# the model while it drafts, so the block above stays rare.
UserPromptSubmit||python3 {NP_DIR}/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook form-directive
